# Language stats (GitHub Linguist) — keep non-project code out of the bar.
# .claude/ is agent tooling (the impeccable skill alone bundles ~1.5 MB of
# .mjs — more than the whole TS app), and design/ holds throwaway HTML/CSS
# mockups. Neither is project source; mark vendored so they don't swamp TS.
.claude/** linguist-vendored
inspector/frontend/design/** linguist-vendored
# Codegen'd FE types are generated, not authored.
inspector/frontend/src/lib/types/generated/** linguist-generated
